# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist): unlock, and the layers SpringBoard has on
# the screen at the home screen (com.hakios.layers, see inject_sb.c), for what draws what where
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 30 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 200 wait 35 notify com.hakios.layers wait 10
